00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:02.515
- Don't stay in tomorrow.

00:00:03.726 --> 00:00:07.893
You've got to at some point
move from tomorrow to right now.

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:13.503
You can't just sit at home
and imagine a Lamborghini

